<http://data.silknow.org/object/cab938ed-46fd-362a-8dfe-a4a248d4aa40>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric of silk satin, Iran, 1800-1899"@en , "Dress fabric of silk satin.\n\nWoven silk, satin ground.\nWarp: dark blue silk, Z-twist.\nWeft: silk: light green pink, light pink, white, all indeterminable twist; there may be more colours.\nDark blue ground with rows of small flowers. Two varieties in alternate bands each with a pair of green leaves. One has rounded petals and one has pointed petals. There are four complete and two partial rows."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/89859a1d-6a8a-3e81-a587-498783634a47> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Dress fabric of silk satin, Iran, 1800-1899"@en , "Dress fabric of silk satin.\n\nWoven silk, satin ground.\nWarp: dark blue silk, Z-twist.\nWeft: silk: light green pink, light pink, white, all indeterminable twist; there may be more colours.\nDark blue ground with rows of small flowers. Two varieties in alternate bands each with a pair of green leaves. One has rounded petals and one has pointed petals. There are four complete and two partial rows."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/cab938ed-46fd-362a-8dfe-a4a248d4aa40/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/cab938ed-46fd-362a-8dfe-a4a248d4aa40/dimension/1> ;
